(6586271, 981575, 45631, '<td valign="top">I will comment on your image due to the incident that occurred.<br/> <br/>It would have been a much stronger image if it had been in focus.  The face of the pumpkin could do with a little more room in front of it which would have shown a little more of the items at the background.  The leaves at the bottom of the image are very dark so maybe would have cropped this up a bit.<br/> <br/>If the image had been in focus I would have scored it higher.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-13 16:05:03.</i></td>', 'I will comment on your image due to the incident that occurred. It would have been a much stronger image if it had been in focus.  The face of the pumpkin could do with a little more room in front of it which would have shown a little more of the items at the background.  The leaves at the bottom of the image are very dark so maybe would have cropped this up a bit. If the image had been in focus I would have scored it higher. Cheers ', '2011-11-06 02:49:30.000000', '2011-11-13 16:05:03.000000', 1),
