(6590360, 981616, 119063, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the votes and positive commments, wow, 4 ten''s?  Thank you so much!!!  I remembered at about 1 hour to close that I have a nice shimmery dark blue backdrop I could have completely gotten rid of the wall and the nasty crack but was too tired to setup again.  I''ll remember that for next time. <br/> <br/>Hoping to be able to carve 3-d one day!<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank you for all the votes and positive commments, wow, 4 ten''s?  Thank you so much!!!  I remembered at about 1 hour to close that I have a nice shimmery dark blue backdrop I could have completely gotten rid of the wall and the nasty crack but was too tired to setup again.  I''ll remember that for next time.  Hoping to be able to carve 3-d one day! Thanks again.', '2011-11-09 08:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
