(6590411, 981779, 131284, '<td valign="top">The images scoring higher than this are perhaps ''better'' pictures or more skilful carvings, but this is the first one to make me laugh. Humour doesn''t need to be refined and I''m glad this scored higher than a 4. That it really wouldn''t have deserved.</td>', 'The images scoring higher than this are perhaps ''better'' pictures or more skilful carvings, but this is the first one to make me laugh. Humour doesn''t need to be refined and I''m glad this scored higher than a 4. That it really wouldn''t have deserved.', '2011-11-09 08:51:29.000000', NULL, 0),
