(6590416, 981826, 131284, '<td valign="top">A shame this didn''t score a bit higher or get more comments. The carving itself may be more simplistic than many of the higher scorers, but the composition and colour of the scene are great, perhaps not nearly the biggest ''wow factor'' from all of the entrants, but one of the most appealing for me.</td>', 'A shame this didn''t score a bit higher or get more comments. The carving itself may be more simplistic than many of the higher scorers, but the composition and colour of the scene are great, perhaps not nearly the biggest ''wow factor'' from all of the entrants, but one of the most appealing for me.', '2011-11-09 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
